    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: The finished scene is <i>Gas-Station.unity</i>. Open it first, look at it from the camera, then build your own version in a new scene next to it. The scene's assets (materials, textures, the pump prefab, the scripts and shaders) are in the same folder, and every step below uses them.
